# floor: the factory floor's machinery, sixteen seconds looping: a warm
# pad drone on a low G and its fifth, struck again every four seconds on
# alternating channels so it swells in a slow pulse, a soft bass drum
# thump every two seconds, a side-stick conveyor tick every half second,
# a low seashore rumble under it all, two short breath-noise pneumatic
# hisses, and two distant bell-and-agogo clanks. Every drone and rumble
# join, the loop's own included, is an end and a start on alternating
# channels, so the seam sounds like the joins inside the piece.
